{
  "id": "6ada0c62564441edf77a64a8",
  "title": "ドーパミンが出る曲",
  "created": 1792674920,
  "updated": 1793304106,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6ada0c62564441edf77a64a8",
      "text": "ドーパミンが出る曲",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792674920,
      "updated": 1792674923
    },
    {
      "id": "6ada0c6d0000000000ca5899",
      "text": "自分はいわゆる[ドパガキ]が好む音楽？をよく聴くほうかもしれない[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792674926,
      "updated": 1793301881
    },
    {
      "id": "6ada0cdb0000000000ca589d",
      "text": "ドパガキというスラングが適切な表現なのかはよくわからず",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792675036,
      "updated": 1792675063
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae397fd00000000002e82c4",
      "text": "\t[|***** [https://music.youtube.com/watch?v=iEBYDR5YOTI&si=kBev-4Uy3Te_Z0re][https://music.youtube.com/watch?v=PkVE3GqMU5U&si=3lFsdtWOYUsmKVNl][https://music.youtube.com/watch?v=V3zmE1rTxP8&si=KLDS-bEk6rUTYDHa][https://music.youtube.com/watch?v=UEpiASdLRYc][https://music.youtube.com/watch?v=2wGFbVwk65c&si=FdHVpWSTojRynIor][https://music.youtube.com/watch?v=-vzvCRCU82g&si=M8bCrqpKaY_KhS-g][https://music.youtube.com/watch?v=_BZTKM839V8&si=GPNvOut-QhEMLSdh][https://music.youtube.com/watch?v=opSUi0npDho&si=LdNJ-EI3Kl6hf1iC][https://music.youtube.com/watch?v=1M4gGbFOweA&si=9QvG4gKwxBeMRemW]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793300477,
      "updated": 1793303863
    },
    {
      "id": "6ada0cf70000000000ca589e",
      "text": "\t[Artcore]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792675063,
      "updated": 1793298072
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3a61d00000000001ef37e",
      "text": "\t　[Ice]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793304093,
      "updated": 1793304093
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3a50a0000000000cc901e",
      "text": "\t　[Laur]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793303818,
      "updated": 1793303825
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3955e0000000000d04629",
      "text": "\t　その他[Noah]、[Sakuzyo]等",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793299806,
      "updated": 1793303837
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3a62a00000000001ef382",
      "text": "　[Symphonic Metal]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793304106,
      "updated": 1793304106
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae38eb00000000000c4bd84",
      "text": "\t高音の女声コーラス・バイオリン・パイプオルガン",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793298097,
      "updated": 1793299769
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae38ee50000000000c4bd85",
      "text": "　[8bit LSDj Remix]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793298150,
      "updated": 1793299796
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae38ff30000000000c4bd8f",
      "text": "\t[行進曲]・[軍歌]（ソ連系）・スポーツ等の[応援歌]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793298420,
      "updated": 1793301997
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae395ed0000000000d0462b",
      "text": "\t[ジョン・ウィリアムズ]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793299949,
      "updated": 1793299958
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae39d520000000000a6ac3d",
      "text": "\t[モーツァルト]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793301842,
      "updated": 1793301848
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae39d5b0000000000a6ac3e",
      "text": "\t　[Dies irae]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793301851,
      "updated": 1793301872
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae3a60700000000001ef37d",
      "text": "\t原曲：[Toby Fox]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793304071,
      "updated": 1793304071
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae394310000000000340a23",
      "text": "\tボス戦BGM",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793299506,
      "updated": 1793299512
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae397020000000000d04636",
      "text": "\t空襲警報のサイレンが使用されている曲",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793300226,
      "updated": 1793300226
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae398dd00000000002e82c5",
      "text": "\t全体的に高音",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793300701,
      "updated": 1793300701
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae397100000000000d04638",
      "text": "\t気持ちのよいフレーズが効果的に再使用される",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793300240,
      "updated": 1793304014
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae396ca0000000000d04633",
      "text": "\t音ゲーはプレイしたことがない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793300170,
      "updated": 1793300191
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae38f2b0000000000c4bd88",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793298220,
      "updated": 1793298220
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae38e390000000000c4bd80",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793297977,
      "updated": 1793297977
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae38e390000000000c4bd81",
      "text": "[h45te.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1793297977,
      "updated": 1793298050
    },
    {
      "id": "6addeedd00000000003eacc8",
      "text": " [waxing and wanding]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792929492,
      "updated": 1792929514
    },
    {
      "id": "6addeefc00000000003eacca",
      "text": " [hajnal]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792929522,
      "updated": 1792929525
    },
    {
      "id": "6addeee100000000003eacc9",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792929496,
      "updated": 1792929496
    },
    {
      "id": "6ada0c6f0000000000ca589a",
      "text": " [音ゲーコア]はもしかしたら関連しそう[h45te.icon]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792674927,
      "updated": 1792929490
    },
    {
      "id": "6adde794000000000010232d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792927630,
      "updated": 1792927630
    },
    {
      "id": "6adeebef00000000003b85f2",
      "text": "[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792994288,
      "updated": 1792994288
    },
    {
      "id": "6adeebb200000000003b85ec",
      "text": "\t[ハードコア]とか？",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792994227,
      "updated": 1793052737
    },
    {
      "id": "6adeebf300000000003b85f3",
      "text": "\tこれも思い出した",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792994292,
      "updated": 1792994292
    },
    {
      "id": "6adeebeb00000000003b85ef",
      "text": "\t\t[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Zem_juz1Hw]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792994284,
      "updated": 1792994285
    },
    {
      "id": "6adeebec00000000003b85f0",
      "text": "\t\t曲というかジャンルか",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792994285,
      "updated": 1792994316
    },
